This directory contains an unmodified copy of the caveman skill from
https://github.com/JuliusBrussee/caveman at commit
bad48a0e1df55e05e3f52249afa35ecc1909ee76.

Source path: skills/caveman/SKILL.md
The same text is what the upstream Cursor plugin loads. Upstream
.cursor-plugin/plugin.json points its skills directory at ./skills/, and
plugins/caveman/skills/caveman/SKILL.md matches skills/caveman/SKILL.md.
SKILL.md in this directory is byte-for-byte that file. It is a local Cursor
agent instruction under .cursor/ and is not part of the published skill set
under skills/.

